## Article 34. Deadlines for Case Resolution

```catala
declaration scope Article34Deadlines:
  input isComplaint content YesNo
  input hearingConducted content YesNo
  output maxResolutionDays content integer

scope Article34Deadlines:
  label default_deadline definition maxResolutionDays equals 30
  
  label hearing_deadline exception default_deadline
  definition maxResolutionDays under condition
    isComplaint = No and hearingConducted = Yes
    consequence equals 45
```
